\pard\sa80\fs22 Populates $Result.VersionCompliant and $Result.VersionWarning. The newest HPEOneView module is backward-compatible with older appliances, so a module whose major version is >= the appliance major version is compatible (VersionCompliant = $true). Only a module OLDER than the appliance (module major < appliance major) is a genuine risk and is flagged. Because automation pins the latest module installed on the server, the module is virtually always newer than or equal to the appliance.\par
